Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:04.48,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,0)\pos(318,319)}12 Hours Until Wednesday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:04.48,Main - Top,ARIES,0,0,0,,We finally have the wall we wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:09.11,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,With Wall Lorna \Nand the might of Lorna herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:12.68,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,we have nothing to fear from Wednesdays!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:16.73,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,But naturally, we still have \Na mountain of problems to deal with,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.73,0:00:19.36,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,the most serious of which is \Nthat we're short-staffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:20.79,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.14,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I have a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:25.19,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Wh-What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:30.80,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,2)\an8\b1\shad0\3c&HC2894C&\c&HF2B39E&}S{\c&HF2BC93&}u{\c&HF3C688&}m{\c&HF3CF7D&}m{\c&HF4D972&}o{\c&HF4E267&}n{\c&HF4E267&} {\c&HF4D972&}S{\c&HF3CF7D&}t{\c&HF3C688&}o{\c&HF2BC93&}n{\c&HF2B39E&}e
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:28.84,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I believe it's an artifact \Ncalled a summon stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:30.80,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Uh, how do I use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.67,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,Where was she keeping that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:34.09,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Like this, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.09,0:00:38.48,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Wait! Everything you do always has crazy—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:44.54,Main,SIX BISHOPS,0,0,0,,We have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.63,0:00:49.03,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:54.68,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,They look like the leaders of an evil cult \Nsecretly plotting to destroy the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.71,0:00:57.95,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,What is our bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:02.58,Main,SIX BISHOPS 6,0,0,0,,The answer is... "eternal."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:04.46,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:07.19,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,They're best buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:11.92,Sign_Basic,SIGN OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(228,0)\b1\pos(352,233.333)\fay.06\shad0\c&HFFFFDA&\3c&HAA4D2D&\frx0\fry14}God
