Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:15.84,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN OP,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,62)}Phantom Leaf acquired.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.05,0:01:18.18,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,0)\pos(317,74)}Headlong Rush
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:43.54,Sign_Basic,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\fs30\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H030103&\shad3\4c&HE6C1CD&\bord0}The World's {\bord1\c&H0000E9&\3c&H1B0792&}S{\c&H0006EA&\3c&H1C0E98&}t{\c&H010CEA&\3c&H1D149D&}r{\c&H0113EB&\3c&H1E1BA3&}o{\c&H0119EC&\3c&H1F22A9&}n{\c&H021FED&\3c&H2028AE&}g{\c&H0225ED&\3c&H212FB4&}e{\c&H032CEE&\3c&H2236BA&}s{\c&H0332EF&\3c&H233CBF&}t{\c&H0338EF&\3c&H2443C5&} {\c&H043EF0&\3c&H2549CA&}W{\c&H0444F1&\3c&H2650D0&}i{\c&H044BF2&\3c&H2757D6&}t{\c&H0551F2&\3c&H285DDB&}c{\c&H0557F3&\3c&H2964E1&}h
