Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.69,0:02:42.92,Main - Top,LORNA,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like your help with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:46.95,Main,SIX BISHOPS 1,0,0,0,,We have been waiting to hear those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:49.61,Main,SIX BISHOPS 2,0,0,0,,The Age of Darkness is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:53.38,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,They've agreed to help. \NNow we'll have more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:55.92,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Um, who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.56,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,My friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:02:59.49,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,That can't be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:02.12,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,They're exuding some kind of dark aura!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:05.92,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,They're really considerate people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:08.58,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,What? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:11.55,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:16.80,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, we've solved \Nour manpower shortage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:20.82,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I'll ask Mr. Dwargo the blacksmith \Nto make equipment for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:25.09,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Rest now to prepare for tomorrow. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:25.97,Main,VILLAGERS,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:29.81,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,This won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:33.48,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I'd like to make that thing now \Nwhile I have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:37.03,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Oh, this could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:40.69,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,But I don't have enough time \Nto gather materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:42.67,Main,SIX BISHOPS 1,0,0,0,,Is something troubling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:44.95,Main,SIX BISHOPS 2,0,0,0,,Tell us. What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:51.46,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,I'm not forging arms and armor \Neven if you've got rare materials. Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:53.32,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:04:00.60,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,I can't forge anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:03.81,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:07.23,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,I'm not changing my mind \Nno matter how many times—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:12.40,Main,SIX BISHOPS 6,0,0,0,,Oh? This is a decent whisk for this era.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:17.82,Main,SIX BISHOPS 4,0,0,0,,With this bowl, we can make \Nan offering of mayonnaise for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:19.52,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,Who are these guys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:25.04,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,who look like the leaders of an evil cult \Nsecretly plotting to destroy the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.43,0:04:26.85,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:31.42,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but you're \NMr. Dwargo Nikodou, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:34.07,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:36.56,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,You have the A-rank blacksmithing skill
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:40.87,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,and made S-rank magic swords in \Nthe Subterranean Kingdom of Dongowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.09,0:04:44.76,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,H-How does she know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.96,0:04:50.02,Flashback,APPRAISER,0,0,0,,This sword is far below \NG-rank. It's S-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:53.40,Flashback,DWARGO,0,0,0,,What? Th-That's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:55.14,Flashback,DWARGO,0,0,0,,That's my masterpiece,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:58.28,Flashback,DWARGO,0,0,0,,and I was the youngest person ever \Nto forge an A-rank sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:02.73,Flashback,SOLDIER 1,0,0,0,,Silence! How dare you \Noffer this trash to the king?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:08.16,Flashback,SOLDIER 1,0,0,0,,The MP of the knight who tested it \Ninstantly fell to zero, knocking him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:11.67,Flashback,DWARGO,0,0,0,,I-I simply tried to forge \Nthe strongest sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:13.85,Flashback,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.85,0:05:16.96,Flashback,KING,0,0,0,,You've disappointed me, Dwargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:22.82,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,After that, I was branded a traitor \Nand banished from the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:26.70,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,I fled to this town far away from my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.19,0:05:31.31,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,Thinking I might forge another S-rank \Nsword makes my hands tremble,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:33.35,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,so I don't forge arms and armor anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:36.77,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,So who is this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.48,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:42.63,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,If I say the key words "strongest sword,"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:49.08,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I believe you'll ask me \Nwhat's your greatest masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:44.87,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,375)\pos(320,115)\an8\fnArial\b1\bord6\shad0\c&HDCB2F8&\3c&H8DC4E2&}S{\c&HCFF4FC&}t{\c&HDEF3D3&}r{\c&HF7F0BE&}o{\c&HF7CACF&}n{\c&HDCB2F8&}g{\c&HCFF4FC&}e{\c&HDEF3D3&}s{\c&HF7F0BE&}t {\c&HF7CACF&}S{\c&HDCB2F8&}w{\c&HCFF4FC&}o{\c&HDEF3D3&}r{\c&HF7F0BE&}d
