Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:51.37,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,375)\pos(320,26)\an8\fnArial\b1\c&H2878D1&\bord0\shad0}What's my greatest masterpiece?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:53.34,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,The answer is "the deteriorated \Nsword in the umbrella stand."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:59.06,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I have a sacred ember, \N30 high-grade coal,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:02.02,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,and 10 mythril whetstones\Nneeded to restore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:06:02.26,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,550)\an8\c&H402403&\3c&HFBF8F4&\4c&H3B280E&\shad2\fs20\b1\pos(138,1)}Sacred Ember
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:06:02.26,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,550)\an8\c&H402403&\3c&HFBF8F4&\4c&H3B280E&\shad2\fs20\b1\pos(320,1)}High-Grade Coal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:02.26,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,550)\an8\c&H402403&\3c&HFBF8F4&\4c&H3B280E&\shad2\fs20\b1\pos(530,1)}Mythril Whetstone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:05.16,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I even defeated the horde \Nof mythril centipedes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:08.26,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,that were going to raid \Nthe Northern Mythril Mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:12.14,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Please give me the S-rank magic \Nsword Deathblade - Kiru-Ichimonji!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:12.14,Sign_Basic,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\an8\fnArial\b1\c&HEE90F6&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HF191F7&\shad2}EXCITED
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:14.74,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Uh, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:18.65,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,I've restored it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:21.43,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,This is the sword you requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:22.78,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:26.49,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,Everything goes so nice and quickly \Nwhen you have the Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:26.49,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(20,15)\fs20\p1\1a&H20&\bord4\shad0\3c&HF5D982&\c&HFFFFFF&}m 0 0 l 250 0 l 250 135 l 0 135
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.78,0:06:26.49,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs12\bord1.5\shad0\c&HFBCBF6&\3c&H000000&\pos(120,20)\bord1\b1}S{\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}-rank\N{\fs10}Weapon: Sword\N{\fs12}Deathblade - Kiru-Ichimonji
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:26.49,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(40,60)\fs10\b1\3c&HF8D469&\shad0}Description
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.78,0:06:26.49,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(27,75)\fs10\b1\shad0\c&H000000&\bord1\3c&HFFFFFF&}Attack +1,111 Speed +111\N All attacks made by this sword are affected by Cleave.\N Equipped Skill: Cleave\N Description: This sword is acquired by completing the\Ndifficult quest, "The Fallen Master Craftsman." Few things\Ncan't be cut by this sword. Despite its many weaknesses\Nand difficulty to use, it's still a popular weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:29.33,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,That sword is heavy. Be careful—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:32.20,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:34.96,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:39.59,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Thank you all for helping me gather items.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:41.64,Main,SIX BISHOPS 6,0,0,0,,You are too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:44.58,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Anyway, this sure is a cool sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:48.34,Main,SIX BISHOP 6,0,0,0,,I had no idea this era had \Nsuch magnificent swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:50.05,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Hey, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:50.89,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.20,0:06:55.20,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,I know I asked you earlier, \Nbut are you sure you want that sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.15,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:58.65,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,This is exactly the sword I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:08.41,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,Now I won't cause cataclysms \Nevery time I attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:12.56,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,Lorna the Swordsman \Nsounds pretty good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:14.20,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:21.46,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,N-No, wait! I didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:25.57,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:31.93,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,0)\pos(320,319)}Title: Tyrant of Destruction acquired!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:29.29,Main - Top,SIX BISHOPS 6,0,0,0,,How merciless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.29,0:07:31.62,Main - Top,SIX BISHOPS 4,0,0,0,,Such is our god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:37.42,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I didn't think \Nthat would happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:46.42,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,Seriously, when did I start forging \Nswords so others would praise me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:50.71,Italics,DWARGO/ID,0,0,0,,Why didn't I believe in my own swords?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:55.95,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I-I'm really sorry! \NI'll pay for the damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:58.00,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.45,0:08:01.89,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about \Nremodeling my shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:06.22,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Miss, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:08.66,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,What? It's Lorna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:12.56,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,I'll remember that. Come back anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:16.83,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,I'll make you an even stronger \Nsword right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:19.85,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:22.08,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:23.77,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:28.66,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Anyway, you've got the mane of \NEleone the Bolt Panthera, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:30.16,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Bring it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:31.66,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:36.66,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,If I stay up all night, I can apply \Nthe lightning element to your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:39.52,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:49.80,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,An even stronger sword, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:51.96,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:54.76,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I just wanted a replacement for a saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:58.03,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Okay, this spot looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:08:59.99,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Petit Wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.19,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:04.81,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Cleave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:07.65,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:10.44,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Now I can make that secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:17.90,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,H-Hey, who's that crazy girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.90,0:09:21.25,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 2,0,0,0,,You don't know? \NThat's Ms. Lorna, the new girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:24.17,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Oh, no. She's up to something again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.18,0:09:28.18,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Lorna, what are you doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:31.70,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Did you feel like doing \Nsome impromptu terraforming?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:33.51,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I'm doing some DIY.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:35.89,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(348.667,106)\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H5E8BC2&\3c&H2E4675&}Dee-Eye-Why
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:35.89,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Dee-Eye-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:40.59,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I'm making an amazing \Nsecret weapon for Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:42.10,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:45.02,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I hope you're excited to see it completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:47.92,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I-I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:51.81,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like you need any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.81,0:09:55.34,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Remember to get \Nsome rest once you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:57.99,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,The battle will start \Nearly tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:59.41,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:02.80,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:12.56,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,I don't know what Lorna's doing, \Nbut I'm so glad she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.39,0:10:19.54,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,If we fail again, I doubt \Nthis city will ever be restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.02,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,Which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:26.68,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,we must end the Wednesdays \Ntomorrow, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:31.53,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Wednesday is starting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:36.28,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Another monster horde \Nwill surely attack the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:38.59,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,As you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:44.38,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,many adventurers have taken \Non Wednesday, failed, and fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:50.48,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Wednesdays are an endless doomed \Nbattle that brings no honor or rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:56.41,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I'm proud of those of you \Nwho have stayed in spite of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:11:01.38,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,We know your love for this city
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:04.23,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,and the effort \Nyou've put in are unmatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:07.23,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 2,0,0,0,,That's why we've stuck with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.35,0:11:09.48,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:12.48,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,Let's beat Wednesday today!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:18.17,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,You're right. \NLet's review the plan one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:21.95,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,First, the defenders will push \Nthe monsters back to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.95,0:11:26.25,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Then the attackers will launch \Nlightning attacks against the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:29.99,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,The wall squad can handle any stragglers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:33.94,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,so keep your eyes forward \Nand attack, attack, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:34.84,Main,VILLAGERS,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:38.49,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Bring your gear to me if it breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.49,0:11:40.97,Main,DWARGO,0,0,0,,Dwargo's Item Shop is here to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:42.94,Main,RESTAURANT OWNER,0,0,0,,Come see me if you get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:45.23,Main,RESTAURANT OWNER,0,0,0,,Today, I'll feed you for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.57,0:11:48.49,Main,FISHERMAN,0,0,0,,We'll fish up all the fish we can, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:52.92,Main,FISHERMAN,0,0,0,,It's all we can do. \NThe rest is up to you, adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:55.62,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Let's go! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:59.63,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,Right now, the entire town \Nis working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:03.13,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,It must be because of Lorna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:08.08,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,Nobody looks like they've lost hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.37,0:12:11.12,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,Let's end this today!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:14.05,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 3,0,0,0,,Let's reclaim this town from Wednesday!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:17.08,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Yes! I know we can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:19.31,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,The sun is rising!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:24.58,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,It'll begin soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:28.14,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs20\p1\bord0\shad0\3c&HF5D982&\c&H2B2B2B&\pos(319,156.667)}m 0 0 l 260 0 l 260 75 l 0 75
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.81,0:12:28.14,RPG_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(319,156)\fs19}6:00 AM Etalia News\NWednesday Quest\N"Water Monster Raid" is starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:30.15,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Let's go, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:32.73,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Today, we will win!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.91,0:12:40.03,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,They're not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:42.85,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 2,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on? \NWhere are the monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.51,0:12:46.00,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,They're coming from above!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:48.74,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 2,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:50.40,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 3,0,0,0,,This is different from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:52.42,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:56.31,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,N-No... But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:13:01.67,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,We prepared, planned, \Nand worked so hard for this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:07.52,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,We even had hope we could \Nend Wednesday this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:12.02,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,How could the scenario change \Nas though to mock our efforts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:16.64,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,Could it be? \NDid they prepare a counter-strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:20.80,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,Our experience won't help us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.53,0:13:22.88,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.69,0:13:25.77,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.08,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Prepare to fight, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.57,0:13:32.69,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Wednesday is starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.55,0:13:38.39,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:42.76,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Hooray! It's just like the Internet said!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:48.71,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Um, I think this is probably \Nthe quickest way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:51.02,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,The quickest... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:57.36,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Lorna, are you the reason the monsters \Nappeared somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:14:02.22,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Yes. The Wednesdays \Nactually won't ever end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.22,0:14:02.96,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:06.32,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,But this should solve your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.93,0:14:09.63,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,All the monsters are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:13.32,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 2,0,0,0,,Do we not have to do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:16.02,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Could you explain what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:17.04,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:21.97,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,That tower is a secret weapon for \Nautomatically defeating the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:29.35,RPG_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs16\bord3\3c&H3726C3&\c&H3826C4&\pos(320,28)}Relocated Spawn Point
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.97,0:14:29.35,RPG_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs16\bord1\3c&HBAEDED&\c&H3826C4&\pos(320,28)}Relocated Spawn Point
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:25.99,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,When there's an object on top \Nof a monster's spawn point,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:29.06,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,they spawn on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:39.52,RPG_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs16\bord3\3c&H3726C3&\c&H3826C4&\pos(416,272)}Spawn Point
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:39.52,RPG_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs16\bord1\3c&HBAEDED&\c&H3826C4&\pos(416,272)}Spawn Point
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.06,0:14:34.84,Main - Top,LORNA,0,0,0,,If you use that to move their spawn \Npoint to a really high location,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:39.52,Main - Top,LORNA,0,0,0,,they're killed by \Nsomething called "fall damage."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:44.18,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Additionally, in the language of the gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:48.66,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,this type of tower that automatically \Ndefeats monsters is called a trap tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:51.64,Italics,ARIES & VILLAGERS/ID,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:56.28,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I-In other words, \Nwith this trap tower thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:15:00.62,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,we can automatically overcome \Nevery Wednesday from now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:05.84,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Yes, and that's the standard strategy \Nfor defeating this Wednesday quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:08.02,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:11.10,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,0)\pos(320,268)\an2}Lorna single-handedly restored the safety\Nof the Port Town of Aquas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:14.60,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:19.78,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,You've worked hard until now! \NDrinks are on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:21.14,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.14,0:15:23.11,Main,VILLAGERS,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:26.89,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,It's Thursday!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.89,0:15:29.99,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 2,0,0,0,,We're finally free from Wednesdays!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.19,0:15:36.25,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,I can't believe we finished \Na Wednesday without any damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.58,0:15:38.64,Main,RESTAURANT OWNER,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:42.11,Main,RESTAURANT OWNER,0,0,0,,You ended our Wednesdays \Nall by yourself at your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.11,0:15:46.49,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,The monsters we struggled \Nagainst fell over instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.23,0:15:50.56,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Let's take a photo to \Ncommemorate, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:52.24,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Oh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:59.52,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,We can't miss this chance \Nto have you wear that, Lorna.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:05.12,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Um, I finished changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.78,0:16:10.28,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Oh, you're so cute! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:15.29,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs20\p1\1a&H20&\bord4\shad0\3c&HF5D982&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(370,11)}m 0 0 l 255 0 l 255 135 l 0 135
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.28,0:16:15.29,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs12\bord1.5\shad0\c&HE4E5D9&\3c&H000000&\bord1\b1\pos(470,16)}E{\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}-rank\N{\fs10}Armor: Clothes\N{\fs12}Sailor Uniform
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:15.29,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\b1\3c&HF8D469&\shad0\pos(390,56)}Description
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.28,0:16:15.29,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\b1\shad0\c&H000000&\bord1\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(375,71)}Defense +50 Spirit +10\N Water Resistance +15%\N Equipped Skill: Sound Collection II\N Description: The traditional outfit of the Port Town of Aquas.\NThough not a strong item, it goes without saying that its\Npopularity is on par with the Royal Academy Uniform\N(AKA the blazer uniform). We know stats aren't everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.43,0:16:14.62,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,How can you be so cute?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.29,0:16:20.41,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Um, Ms. Aries? Do I look weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:24.44,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Not at all! If anything, \Nyou look radiant, Lorna!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:25.45,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:29.84,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I knew I was right about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:35.28,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Um, it's a bit embarrassing \Nwhen you stare so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:40.56,Main,FEMALE ADVENTURER 2,0,0,0,,Now, now. Just ignore her. \NLet's take the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:51.72,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}this{\i0} is real seafood. It's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:56.89,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,Monsters won't destroy and pillage \Nour boats, shops, or warehouses anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:17:00.85,Main,MALE ADVENTURER 2,0,0,0,,We can eat all the fish \Nwe want from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:02.96,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:09.65,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I tried making tartar sauce using the \Nmayonnaise my black-robed friends made.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:11.34,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:14.58,Main,FISHERMAN,0,0,0,,This tastes great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:17.62,Main,FISHERMAN,0,0,0,,This could become \Nour town's new specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:19.23,Main,FEMALE ADVENTURER 1,0,0,0,,I love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:23.62,Main,SIX BISHOPS 6,0,0,0,,So this is what mayonnaise can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:26.51,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Are you having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:28.19,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Ms. Aries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:32.15,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Thank you for treating me to such a feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:35.59,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:36.44,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:39.95,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I'd actually given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.64,0:17:45.93,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I thought we'd never end the Wednesdays. \NI thought this town was done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:53.49,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I never imagined we'd get \Nto party like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:18:00.91,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be talking \Nlike this at a fun event.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:05.73,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,But truly, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:10.87,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Not at all. \NBesides, you should thank the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:12.18,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,The gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:16.16,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Yes. Um, it's hard to explain,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.16,0:18:21.62,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,but my skill allows me to hear \Nthe words of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:26.42,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I didn't come up with \Nthat strategy. The gods did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:30.18,Italics,ARIES/ID,0,0,0,,A girl loved by the gods...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:35.14,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,You really are an angel, Lorna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.82,0:18:42.76,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Oh, we should also discuss the fee for \Nusing Wall Lorna and the trap tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:44.19,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Fee?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:48.69,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Yes. We couldn't possibly \Nuse those for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:54.32,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,That said, there's no precedent, so it'll\Ntake time to find the right price.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:59.34,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,For now, we'll deposit around this amount \Ninto your guild account every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.30,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:03.67,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,U-Um, I can't accept that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:06.62,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,And you never asked me to make those!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.98,0:19:09.70,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,What we're paying you isn't nearly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:11.42,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:16.47,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I thought your town didn't have \Nmuch money right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.47,0:19:17.97,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.47,0:19:21.25,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,If I have to, I'll lick the boots \Nof some important people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:22.72,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I-In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:26.43,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,please use this money \Nto revitalize your town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:31.23,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Personally, enjoying the sights here \Nmatters more to me than the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:32.94,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,Lorna...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:37.38,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,You're too sweet! What an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:39.95,Sign_Basic,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fad(425,0)\pos(330,134)\an8\fnArial\b1\c&HFADE68&\3c&HFFFFF3&\4c&HD2B392&}SQUEEEEEZE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.81,0:19:39.62,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,She smells like liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:43.87,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll use the money \Nto revitalize the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.51,0:19:48.63,Main,ARIES,0,0,0,,But I'll make sure you can access it \Nthrough the guild anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:52.12,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,U-Um, that's fine for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.13,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz15\move(410,445,250,-80)}Wednesday Quest: Water Monster Raid has been completed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:56.34,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz15\move(410,445,255,-80)}Water Mirror Aegis acquired!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:19:56.55,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz15\move(410,450,255,-75)}Ancient Medal x10 acquired!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.01,0:19:56.76,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz15\move(410,450,255,-72)}50,000 shil acquired!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.22,0:19:56.97,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz15\move(410,455,255,-67)}50,000 EXP acquired!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.64,0:19:57.39,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz15\move(410,460,255,-62)}System: Fast Travel unlocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:57.61,Floating_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz15\move(410,460,255,-62)}Title: Guardian of Wednesday acquired!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.64,0:19:59.09,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,What are these? A completion reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:04.19,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,I'm genuinely glad \Nfor the 50,000 shil and EXP,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:10.10,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,but I don't know what Fast Travel \Nand the Water Mirror Aegis are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:12.11,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(20,15)\fs20\p1\1a&H20&\bord4\shad0\3c&HF5D982&\c&HFFFFFF&}m 0 0 l 250 0 l 250 120 l 0 120
