Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.10,0:20:12.11,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(40,60)\fs10\b1\3c&HF8D469&\shad0}Description
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.10,0:20:12.11,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(27,75)\fs10\b1\shad0\c&H000000&\bord1\3c&HFFFFFF&}Defense +808 Spirit +808 Petrification Resistance +100%\N Equipped Skill: Reflection\N Description: The S-rank reward from the Wednesday quest.\NFor a free item, it's pretty broken. The bonuses to\Ndefenses and offensive firepower are powerful...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.55,0:20:12.33,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:18.11,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(325,0)\an7\pos(20,15)\fs20\p1\1a&H20&\bord0\shad0\3c&HF5D982&\c&HFFFFFF&\t(353,560,1 \bord2}m 0 0 l 250 0 l 250 80 l 0 80
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.52,0:20:18.11,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(175,0)\an7\pos(40,20)\fs10\b1\3c&HF8D469&\shad0}System
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.52,0:20:18.11,Sign_Basic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(175,0)\an7\pos(27,40)\fs10\b1\shad0\c&H000000&\bord1\3c&HFFFFFF&}Fast Travel\N\NA system skill unlocked once level 50 is reached.\NAllows one to teleport to locations they have visited.\NBe careful. It can't be used indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:18.11,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,Yeah. I still don't get it, \Nbut they sound amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:21.99,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,For now, I'll test the Water Mirror Aegis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:26.82,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I wonder what makes it float.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:31.16,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,It kind of stands out and would \Nget in the way most of the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:34.28,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,so I guess I'd only use it in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.37,0:20:37.91,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,H-Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.33,0:20:41.29,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,This is kind of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:44.73,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Maybe I should check my stats. \NIt's been a while.
