Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.64,0:20:53.30,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,My defense has finally \Nreached four digits, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:56.26,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,My defense was only \Naround nine until recently.
