Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:58.89,Italics,LORNA/ID,0,0,0,,I've got a bunch of skills \NI don't understand, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:03.49,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Anyway, I guess I'll test \Nits equipped skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.87,0:21:05.12,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Reflection!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:06.45,RPG_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,275.333)\an5\fs24}\h\hReflection\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.98,0:21:11.08,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,This barrier reflects magic, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:12.52,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Petit Heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:12.83,RPG_Text_Box,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,275.333)\an5\fs24}Petit Heal
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:17.70,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,This could be a useful skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:20.46,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,With this, I don't have to fear \Nany spells that come at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:23.38,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,and it never hurts to have \Nmore defensive skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:28.93,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I'm just glad this isn't a dangerous \Nitem that causes cata...
