Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:41.55,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Fast travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:45.66,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,It'll take me to these places, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:48.33,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,Might as well try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.77,0:21:50.58,Main,LORNA,0,0,0,,I'll go to Aiphoné first.
